--- OPES_hydrolysis (pph3) ---

OPES metadynamics runs of the pph3 (tri-protonated pyrophosphate) hydrolysis, the benchmark/
comparison system to the pph4 analysis in ../../pph4/. Same OPES-on-'dD' protocol as
../../pph4/rep_1/ (see that folder's README), producing 'COLVAR'/'Coord.info'/'KERNELS' and
the NNP-committee 'model_devi'-style deviation logs; the accompanying 'OPES_additional.info'/
'OPES_dD.info' record the reweighted bias/CV series used to reconstruct the free-energy
surface with ../../codes/FES_2D.py once the run is complete (still accumulating as of the
last check, no FES_2D.png yet for this system).

Three replicas (rep_1/2/3) — one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
